<title>SPAIN: Spanish oil refinery Petronor sells two tankers.</title>
<headline>Spanish oil refinery Petronor sells two tankers.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish refinery Petronor, part of the Repsol energy group, has put its two tankers, Butron and Arteaga, up for sale a spokesman told Reuters on Monday.</p>
<p>He confirmed a report published on Monday by the financial daily Cinco Dias.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the sale could add about 10 billion pesetas to Petronor's coffers, but the spokesman said it was too early to comment on the amount.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
